  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yMkEnaL.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husks-drop-sand\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/476656?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhusks-drop-sand\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/husks-drop-sand?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個完全可配置的模組讓屍殼在死亡時有機率掉落沙子。既然屍殼生成在沙漠中，牠們身上卡著一些沙子也很合理。這是一個簡單的調整，能實現平衡的主世界沙子農場——不需要破壞整個沙漠。&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ESe7V8v.gif\"></p><h6><strong>配置設定</strong></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以直接在遊戲中配置這個模組，或編輯個人資料資料夾中的JSON檔案<code>config/huskssand.json</code>。請注意，任何變更都需要重新啟動Minecraft才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>min_rolls</strong> - 設定可掉落沙塊的最小數量</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>max_rolls</strong> - 設定可掉落沙塊的最大數量</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
